	"description": "The Codex workbench: the coordinator, the workhorses, the conversation and the voice. It grows over TASK-500.23.01 to .07; so far it holds the browser-safe contracts that the browser and the server exchange, the Codex runtime (the foundation, the coordinator with its callbacks, tool calls and spoken approval, and the workhorses) and the server's gateway: the browser connections, their commands and leases, and the projection of the workbench into the snapshot a pane renders.",
